@startuml 08-Run
' 5층 Run — 런 데이터: 경험치 · 골드 · 덱 · 파티 상태 · 지도 · 카드 제안 규칙.
' 런의 주인(GameManager · 9 App)은 IRunHost로만 보인다.
title 5층 Run (Progression) — 클래스 다이어그램

set separator none
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

package "5 Run (Progression)" {
  package "런 상태" as PState {
    class RunProgression {
      + {static} Current : RunProgression
      + Exp · Level · Gold : int
      + Cards : IReadOnlyList<ComboCard>
      + Party : PartyState
      + Seeded : bool
      + OnChanged : event Action
      + BankExp(amount) / SettleExp() : int
      + SeedDeck(cards)
      + PurgeRole(role) : int
    }
    class PartyState {
      + HeroHpRatio : float
      + IsDead(member) : bool
      + HpRatioOf(member) : float
      + DeadCount : int
    }
    interface IRunHost {
      + Run : RunProgression
      + DeckStartupMode : DeckStartupMode
      + Loadout : PartyLoadout
    }
    class RunHost <<static>> {
      + Current : IRunHost
    }
    enum DeckStartupMode {
      Party · Pick · Empty
    }
  }

  package "규칙" as PRules {
    class ExpRules <<static>> {
      + TierCount · BaseCost · LevelGrowth
      + GoldenDamageMul = ComboCard.GoldenDamageMul
      + CostOf(level, tier) : int
    }
    class ExpRewards <<static>> {
      + Award(enemy)
      + Settle()
      .. Enemy.Defeated 구독 ..
    }
    class GoldRules <<static>> {
      + CardPrice · GoldenCardPrice
      + StageClearReward(floor, kind) : int
      + PriceOf(offer) : int
    }
    class NodeRules <<static>> {
      + RestHealRatio
      + AvailableRoles(roster, state) : List<Role>
    }
    class CardOffer <<struct>> {
      + data : SkillData
      + golden : bool
      + fuses : bool
    }
    class CardOfferRules <<static>> {
      + OfferCount · FuseCopies = 3
      + Build(pool, …) : List<CardOffer>
    }
    class CardGrantRules <<static>> {
      + Apply(deck, pick) : ComboCard
      + RemoveNormalCopies(deck, data, count) : int
    }
    class CardOfferView {
      + OnPicked : event Action<int>
      + Build(parent, slot) / Show(offer)
      .. 카드 그림 (레벨업 · 상점 공용) ..
    }
    class SkillCatalog <<ScriptableObject>> {
      + Skills : IReadOnlyList<SkillData>
      + {static} Get() : SkillCatalog
      + {static} Pool(roles, fallback) : List<SkillData>
    }
    class RunEventAsset <<ScriptableObject>> {
      + title : string
      + choices : RunEventChoice[]
    }
    class RunEventRules <<static>> {
      + CanChoose(choice, gold) : bool
      + Apply(choice, run, …) : bool
    }
  }

  package "지도" as PMap {
    class RunMap {
      + Seed : int
      + FloorCount : int
      + NodesOn(floor) : IReadOnlyList<MapNode>
      + Get(id) : MapNode
    }
    class MapNode {
      + Id · Floor · Column : int
      + Kind : MapNodeKind
      + Scene : string
      + Next : IReadOnlyList<int>
      + RoomPercent : int
    }
    enum MapNodeKind {
      Battle · Elite · Rest
      Shop · Event · Boss
    }
    class RunMapProgress {
      + Map : RunMap
      + Current · Pending : int
      + CurrentNode : MapNode
    }
    class RunMapRecipe <<ScriptableObject>> {
      + floors : FloorRule[]
      + TryGenerate(seed, out map, out issues) : bool
    }
    class RunMapGenerator <<static>> {
      + TryGenerate(floors, seed, …) : bool
    }
    class RunMapRules <<static>> {
      + EncounterOf(node) : EncounterModifier
      + IsBattle(kind) · CanSkipScene(kind)
      + GetsRoomModifier(kind) : bool
    }
  }
}

RunProgression *--> PartyState
RunProgression o--> "*" "ComboCard (2)" : Cards
RunProgression ..> RunHost : Current
RunHost o--> IRunHost
IRunHost ..> DeckStartupMode
IRunHost ..> "PartyLoadout (4.5)"
ExpRewards ..> RunProgression : BankExp · SettleExp
ExpRewards ..> "Enemy (3)" : Defeated 구독
CardOfferRules ..> CardOffer
CardGrantRules ..> CardOffer
CardOfferView ..> CardOffer
GoldRules ..> CardOffer
SkillCatalog ..> "SkillData (2)"
RunEventRules ..> RunEventAsset
RunEventRules ..> RunProgression
RunMap *--> "*" MapNode
MapNode --> MapNodeKind
RunMapProgress --> RunMap
RunMapRecipe ..> RunMapGenerator
RunMapGenerator ..> RunMap
RunMapRules ..> MapNode
RunMapRules ..> "EncounterModifier (4)"

note bottom of IRunHost
  구현: GameManager (9 App).
  비어 있으면 RunProgression.Current는 단독 런을 만든다.
end note

' 하위 패키지 순서 (넓은 그림이 PNG 폭 4096 한도에 걸리지 않게)
PState -[hidden]down- PRules
PRules -[hidden]down- PMap
@enduml
